      "created_at": "2021-02-05T10:25:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What do you think of the new games this year? I think that all titles are outdated. I was really looking forward to OW2 and Diablo 4, but the Blizzards said that it should not be expected in 2021. All games are monotonous, I hope that big companies will come up with some kind of new genre, as it was with battle royals that you can dive into.</p>",
